{"name": "Dodo Duckie", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quack the code of reality as the clumsy yet courageous duck <strong>Dodo</strong> and traverse bizarre yet charming planets to rescue your kidnapped chicken kin and master impossible new abilities with every waddle to solve puzzles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What begins as a lighthearted rescue mission unfurls into a profound, heartfelt journey of self-discovery, where perhaps even a clumsy duck can find a home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras_big/14364cc84e01c1b0a4aa40e3dabc600b.webp?t=1787288705\" height=\"284\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/14364cc84e01c1b0a4aa40e3dabc600b.avif?t=1787288705\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It was a peaceful day on the farm\u2026 until a giant alien beam yoinked your chicken family into the sky. With nothing but his waddle, his will, and a very special cap, Dodo dives into a glitched dimension to bring them back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"516\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/0af3b846ccc4f9a6a085d822711b74d5.poster.avif?t=1787288705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/0af3b846ccc4f9a6a085d822711b74d5.webm?t=1787288705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/0af3b846ccc4f9a6a085d822711b74d5.mp4?t=1787288705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras_big/990d1be89015b9eb33101feb99f09392.webp?t=1787288705\" height=\"284\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/990d1be89015b9eb33101feb99f09392.avif?t=1787288705\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two dimensions, one adventure. With Capie the Capybara's magical cap, you can flip between side-scrolling and 3rd Person view whenever you like. Swap perspectives to reveal hidden paths and surprise platforms, and use them to crack every puzzle and peek into every corner of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"458\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/4183e399417f80dcd6890123596c5192.poster.avif?t=1787288705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/4183e399417f80dcd6890123596c5192.webm?t=1787288705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/4183e399417f80dcd6890123596c5192.mp4?t=1787288705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras_big/d593c7bbbee267d0c9137c32dc363587.webp?t=1787288705\" height=\"284\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/d593c7bbbee267d0c9137c32dc363587.avif?t=1787288705\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodo does a lot more than waddle. Glide over gaps, splash through water, float, flop, and improvise your way through each puzzle. Every move fits into the way you explore, experiment and solve weird little alien puzzles. And yes, there is a dedicated quack button. Hit Q to QUACK, scare some aliens, and calm your own brain at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"416\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/42dd979c8a91f10725d10b6b82c00a92.poster.avif?t=1787288705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/42dd979c8a91f10725d10b6b82c00a92.webm?t=1787288705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/42dd979c8a91f10725d10b6b82c00a92.mp4?t=1787288705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras_big/fb60621222d0447285113f25579420a8.webp?t=1787288705\" height=\"284\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/fb60621222d0447285113f25579420a8.avif?t=1787288705\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop from one odd and adorable planet to the next, each stranger and cuter than the last. Collect shiny stardust, uncover secret routes, and meet Capie, the chill shopkeeper who sells very good caps. Don\u2019t forget to take advantage of every very silly photo opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"458\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/e77f731763595177d76bcab8ddb207f8.poster.avif?t=1787288705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/e77f731763595177d76bcab8ddb207f8.webm?t=1787288705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/e77f731763595177d76bcab8ddb207f8.mp4?t=1787288705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras_big/e900b0de90a57be598c70dfbebdfe63f.webp?t=1787288705\" height=\"284\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/e900b0de90a57be598c70dfbebdfe63f.avif?t=1787288705\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodo wobbles, trips, and occasionally face-plants, but never gives up on its chicken family. Underneath the clumsy feet is a very determined little heart. Ready to accompany this adorable little duckie? This adventure is full of quacks, caps, and chaos, so grab the hat and jump in. Your next adventure (and your next cute screenshot) is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/18559955a1bfac4866d28f7abb13639c.poster.avif?t=1787288705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/18559955a1bfac4866d28f7abb13639c.webm?t=1787288705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/18559955a1bfac4866d28f7abb13639c.mp4?t=1787288705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Waddle into a reality-bending odyssey where simply being a duck is your greatest superpower. With the help of your magical cap, switch instantly between 2D and 3D to uncover hidden paths, outsmart aliens, and rescue your kidnapped chicken friends in this wholesome puzzle platformer adventure.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/a5c63fced6dfd9f0a83650eb35332f0058636405/header.jpg?t=1787288705", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle Platformer", "Platformer", "Puzzle", "Exploration", "Collectathon", "Capybaras"], "developers": "BornMonkie", "publishers": "BornMonkie", "release_date": "Jul 23, 2026", "price": "$11.99", "appid": "3358170", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "10 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/XWogpcLKNWQ", "first_seen": 1770678000.0, "review_rank": 1239}